        "Abstract": "In this paper, we construct a large-scale Japanese image caption dataset based on images from MS-COCO, called STAIR Captions. STAIR Captions consists of 820,310 Japanese captions for 164,062 images. We show that a neural network trained using STAIR Captions can generate more natural and better Japanese captions, compared to those generated using English-Japanese machine translation after generating English captions."
